  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tGeneral\n\t\tGeneral\n\n### How do Clients Login?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 8 Oct, 2025 at  5:03 PM\n\n\t\tAfter you have set up your client users (if you haven't done this, please visit this article), they will be able to log into Capium themselves.\n\nWhen they go to login, they should see this page:\n\nClient users should always use the middle login option, which will take them to this page:\n\nThis is where they can use their email and password to log in.\n\nIf your client user is still facing trouble with logging in, we suggest first looking to see if their user is active. To do this, navigate to the users section in My Admin:\n\nHere, you will be able to see which users are active and inactive. To change the status of any of these users, click the box at the far left of the row:\n\nYou will then be able to see a drop down where you can choose from either active or inactive.\n\nIf you client is still facing trouble, please either contact support@capium.com, or your account manager.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000092543\">General</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000189872\">General</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How do Clients Login?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 8 Oct, 2025 at  5:03 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">After you have set up your client users (if you haven't done this, please visit <a href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/9000149683-how-to-add-users-and-allocate-permissions\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">this article</a>), they will be able to log into Capium themselves.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">When they go to <a href=\"https://account.capium.com/Account/Login\">login</a>, they should see this page:</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9238317930/original/K-wxgxrgi_Gx_rg0y6lAGaMGLqoFzUXSAQ.png?1759938130\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9238317930\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Client users should always use the middle login option, which will take them to this page:</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9238317997/original/K0YnsDKSvNz7Hr-p_6G8dZmJrNSmN29oCA.png?1759938185\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9238317997\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">This is where they can use their email and password to log in.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">If your client user is still facing trouble with logging in, we suggest first looking to see if their user is active. To do this, navigate to the users section in My Admin:</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9238318196/original/Q5O4wNGQbGPrGLhmPaodOJ_LmIp6Kt99lw.png?1759938329\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9238318196\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Here, you will be able to see which users are active and inactive. To change the status of any of these users, click the box at the far left of the row:</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9238318245/original/q4bwEZlQT72T21XWxE4IgbtQh_RI89Wo4A.png?1759938406\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9238318245\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You will then be able to see a drop down where you can choose from either active or inactive.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">If you client is still facing trouble, please either contact <a data-fr-linked=\"true\" href=\"mailto:support@capium.com,\">support@capium.com,</a>&nbsp;or your account manager.</p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000271567\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000271567/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000271567\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000271567/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000271567\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.</div>\t<div id=\"vote-feedback-form\">\t\t<div class=\"sloading loading-small loading-block\"></div>\t</div></div>\n\t\t\n"
